      "source": [
        "### 5. Domestic & Location Risk — How do domestic-flagged incidents and location descriptors (street, residence, commercial) vary across community areas, and did the pandemic year of 2020 meaningfully alter these distributions?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YU7PNN_stVGS"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Findings: <br>\n",
        "After 2020, overall there was increase in domestic-flagged incidents in 2021 whereby it was majority of the incident in all of the high-crime community areas."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MqZhp3jBrj5S"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import plotly.express as px\n",
        "\n",
        "# Group by Year, Community Area, and Domestic flag to see how distribution varies\n",
        "domestic_community = df.groupby(['Year', 'Community Area', 'Domestic']).size().reset_index(name='Incidents')\n",
        "total_community = df.groupby(['Year', 'Community Area']).size().reset_index(name='Total_Incidents')\n",
        "\n",
        "domestic_rates = pd.merge(domestic_community[domestic_community['Domestic'] == True], total_community, on=['Year', 'Community Area'])\n",
        "domestic_rates['Domestic_Rate_%'] = (domestic_rates['Incidents'] / domestic_rates['Total_Incidents'] * 100).round(2)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Focus on the Top 15 Community Areas with the most incidents to keep it readable\n",
        "top_communities = total_community.groupby('Community Area')['Total_Incidents'].sum().nlargest(15).index\n",
        "domestic_rates_filtered = domestic_rates[domestic_rates['Community Area'].isin(top_communities)]\n",
        "domestic_rates_filtered = domestic_rates_filtered.sort_values(by='Domestic_Rate_%', ascending=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "fig_domestic_risk = px.bar(\n",
        "    domestic_rates_filtered,\n",
        "    x='Community Area',\n",
        "    y='Domestic_Rate_%',\n",
        "    color='Year',\n",
        "    barmode='group',\n",
        "    title='Domestic Incident Rate (%) Across Top 15 High-Crime Community Areas (2020-2022)',\n",
        "    labels={'Domestic_Rate_%': 'Domestic Incidents Rate (%)', 'Community Area': 'Community Area ID'},\n",
        "    color_discrete_sequence=px.colors.qualitative.Safe\n",
        ")\n",
        "fig_domestic_risk.update_layout(xaxis=dict(type='category'))\n",
        "fig_domestic_risk.show()"
